          "fontWeight": "{fontWeight.extra-light}",
          "fontSize": "187.5px",
          "lineHeight": "183.75px",
          "letterSpacing": "-11.25px"
        },
        "$description": "Computed h1 at 1440x900. The token --font-size-h1 is 25rem, and the root font-size there is 7.5px, so 25rem is 187.5px. At 390 the same heading computed to 64px.",
        "$extensions": {"source": {"evidence": "Measured", "capture": "home h1 computed style, 1440x900"}}
      },
      "section": {
        "$type": "typography",
        "$value": {
          "fontFamily": "{font.family.marketing}",
          "fontWeight": "{fontWeight.extra-light}",
          "fontSize": "103.505px",
          "lineHeight": "90.0495px",
          "letterSpacing": "-6.21031px"
        },
        "$description": "Computed h2 Complete creative control at the first viewport (1169px wide, html font-size 6.08854px). At 1440 the pricing hero h1 used 187.5px instead.",
        "$extensions": {"source": {"evidence": "Reconstruction", "capture": "home h2 computed style, entered by hand at capture time; raw/computed.json holds no reading of it"}}
      },
      "button": {
        "$type": "typography",
        "$value": {
          "fontFamily": "{font.family.marketing}",
          "fontWeight": "{fontWeight.button}",
          "fontSize": "13.5px",
          "lineHeight": "13.5px",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.24px"
